{"version":1,"content":"<p>在香港，食牛扒有好多選擇，無論是平民之選還是奢華經典，總有一款能滿足肉食控的胃。</p><p>近日有親民的扒房開幕，又有高級扒房推出主題菜單，無論你追求的是性價比，還是大師級的頂級肉食，都值得你第一時間前去朝聖。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:21:14.050341+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:00:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:18:22.231543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:18:22.231543+00:00","content_hash":"936281479cb8ce0d376924d12b0176a081bfd2d1a66340c59e471bcb85a7a0cf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}